      "content": "Here are detailed profiles for your gritty crime drama characters:\n\n**The Gang Leader**: Elias \"Rook\" Thorne is a 42-year-old Greek immigrant from a remote island town in Thrace, known for his intense, mountainous build and stubborn demeanor. He wears worn-out leather jackets and cargo pants that hint at a history of street survival. His face carries the deep-set scratches and calloused hands befitting a man who has spent decades navigating dangerous streets with no bitterness left in his heart.\n\n**The Corporate Lawyer**: Aria Vassilikiou is a 38-year-old Greek-Italian hybrid who grew up in modern-day Athens before moving to the city as a corporate strategist. She possesses a sculpted, athletic physique maintained through disciplined gym culture and a sharp, intellectual warmth. She dresses in tailored suits and silk scarves that offer a subtle but undeniable air of power and sophistication. Both characters carry the arrival from Greece onto the modern American scene, giving them an intensity and a distinct cultural texture.",
